# A [[bluefish]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2012|author=Lenny Rudow|title=Rudow's Guide to Fishing the Mid Atlantic|page=102|passage='''Blues''' are about as vicious a fish as you'll find on the Atlantic seaboard &mdash; they will continue to slash through schools of bait even after they have eaten so much that they're constantly regurgitating shredded baitfish.}}
